bugLogs.suggested_fix:
Update the CSS for the error message to use a darker color that meets the required contrast. For example:
css
#error-msg, #card-error {
  color: #cc0000; /* dark red with ~4.6:1 contrast on white */
}

Alternatively, change the background to a slightly off‑white (e.g., #f5f5f5) while keeping the original text color, ensuring the resulting ratio is ≥4.5:1. Verify the change with an automated contrast checker.
